  "dish": {
    "id": "baked-coconut-chips",
    "name": "Baked coconut chips",
    "meal": "Snack",
    "minutes": 45,
    "protein": 0,
    "how": "Gas + air fryer",
    "tools": "Mandoline, baking tray with baking paper, gas, air fryer or oven",
    "serves": 4,
    "cover": "cover",
    "ingredients": [
      {
        "q": "1 whole coconut (hard, brown)",
        "n": "Fresh coconut (nariyal)",
        "tag": "coconut",
        "img": "i-coconut"
      },
      {
        "q": "~1 tsp",
        "n": "Oil",
        "tag": "oil",
        "img": "i-oil"
      },
      {
        "q": "~1 tbsp",
        "n": "Powdered sugar",
        "tag": "sugar"
      },
      {
        "q": "a pinch",
        "n": "Salt",
        "tag": "salt"
      }
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "t": "Crack the coconut open and drain the water into a bowl.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-break-1",
          "s-break-2",
          "s-break-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Heat each coconut half, shell side down, over the gas flame.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-heat-1",
          "s-heat-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Put the hot half in a bowl of water. Repeat until the brown shell comes off.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-dip-1",
          "s-dip-2",
          "s-dip-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Slice the white coconut very thin on a mandoline, onto a lined baking tray.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-slice-1",
          "s-slice-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Spread the slices out in a single layer.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-spread-1",
          "s-spread-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Drizzle a little oil over the slices.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-oil-1",
          "s-oil-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Sprinkle on the powdered sugar and salt.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-sugar-1",
          "s-sugar-2",
          "s-sugar-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Mix with your hands so every slice is coated.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-mix-1",
          "s-mix-2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Bake until golden brown.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-bake-1",
          "s-bake-2",
          "s-bake-3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "t": "Let the chips cool, then store in an airtight jar for up to 10 days.",
        "imgs": [
          "s-store-1",
          "s-store-2"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "tags": [
      "gas",
      "air-fryer",
      "make-ahead"
    ],
    "notes": "From a '9 things from one coconut' reel: only the chips are made here (water, milk, cream, oil, desiccated coconut skipped; milk is its own dish). No amounts, oven temperature or time shown: all guesses. Video bakes in an oven; air fryer not shown, so start low and watch closely. Shell-removal trick (heat, dip in water) shown briefly. No clear frame of the sugar or salt, so no thumbnails for them."
